{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Chroma Academy... Learn a craft. Harness magic. Discover your true calling. And maybe, save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the next generation of young wizards as they clean-up and combat hazardous environments and enemies, to restore balance in a land corrupted by poisonous fallout from an ancient magical battle between two feuding sorceress sisters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Features</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/2716fe1c0244658819c710cb0b899150.avif?t=1749340310\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your match-3 combos determine your movement range, and your match-3 score dictates the damage you can inflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/e1d3fc3233fc04ab28589a5341e0d939.poster.avif?t=1749340310\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/e1d3fc3233fc04ab28589a5341e0d939.webm?t=1749340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/e1d3fc3233fc04ab28589a5341e0d939.mp4?t=1749340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/b4dd231844918ddc71de3f9a6e8413c6.avif?t=1749340310\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same, offering a fresh experience with different rooms, enemies, and layouts each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/10c0ff22327357717b1dc4504737a82d.avif?t=1749340310\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create new character builds in every run by collecting various items that can significantly alter your character's progression and playstyle throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/afc355bd1af4c9a17af6444a83ef2726.poster.avif?t=1749340310\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/afc355bd1af4c9a17af6444a83ef2726.webm?t=1749340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/afc355bd1af4c9a17af6444a83ef2726.mp4?t=1749340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3189890?t=1749340310","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749340310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/ba34b2e228896fd9d3cbfc2d81ecb360263c1e7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749340310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/ba34b2e228896fd9d3cbfc2d81ecb360263c1e7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749340310","categories":[{"description":