tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/b4dd231844918ddc71de3f9a6e8413c6.avif?t=1749340310\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same, offering a fresh experience with different rooms, enemies, and layouts each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/10c0ff22327357717b1dc4504737a82d.avif?t=1749340310\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create new character builds in every run by collecting various items that can significantly alter your character's progression and playstyle throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/afc355bd1af4c9a17af6444a83ef2726.poster.avif?t=1749340310\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/afc355bd1af4c9a17af6444a83ef2726.webm?t=1749340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/extras/afc355bd1af4c9a17af6444a83ef2726.mp4?t=1749340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["FourFox Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189890/af97e7149af5ef09c841cf56f48779b346baa195/header.jpg?t=1749340310","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3189890/157456298